---
import LaunchLink from "./LaunchLink.astro";
import ProductFolder from "./ProductFolder.astro";
---

<section id="home" class="hero">
  <h1>Business Payments<br />For the World</h1>
  <ProductFolder />
  <p>Business payments on any chain, from the dashboard or from a chat. Invoices, payment links and a checkout API that accept any token on any chain, plus payouts and payroll to any chain. Run it from Telegram with <code>pay Ada 50 on base</code>. Everything settles in USDC on NEAR, signed with a passkey, with no gas.</p>
  <LaunchLink class="light-button">Open an account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></LaunchLink>
</section>
